This standalone example adds Color Match, wallet-isolated recovery storage,
embedded Connect with an explicit popup fallback, a one-button paid-play flow,
local unrecorded Practice, player wallet and purchase recovery surfaces,
published-package imports, SDK-backed public scoring reads, and a self-contained
two-game archive builder. The generic player-shell flow follows patterns from
https://github.com/hs7j4yk4sz-boop/wall-arcade-connect (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026
NFC Summit); game protocols, server verification and payment terms remain
specific to this repository.

